{"meta":{"id":"err-archive:1146416","type":"series","name":"Miks mitte?!","poster":"https://s.err.ee/photo/crop/2020/04/09/768394h70a8t80.jpg","background":"https://s.err.ee/photo/crop/2018/11/16/583057hea4ft48.jpg","genres":["Draama"],"description":"Anna on gümnaasiumi viimases klassis ja peaks agaralt õppima ning ülikooli peale mõtlema. Tema aga unistab hoopis räppariks saamisest! Pöörane mõte – seda enam, et ta on sünnipärane kokutaja. Takkapihta ei ole ta üldse klassikalise räppari moodi – Anna on nohik ja tuupur. Aga see kevad muudab tema elu täielikult! Ja mitte ainult Anna elu ei muutu – kogu ta pere kistakse peadpööritavasse keerisesse. Stsenarist Martin Algus, režissöör Ergo Kuld.","videos":[{"id":"err-archive:1136218","title":"Miks mitte?!","season":1,"episode":1,"thumbnail":"https://s.err.ee/photo/crop/2018/11/16/583057h1b23t34.jpg","released":"2020-09-17"},{"id":"err-archive:1138853","title":"Miks mitte?!","season":1,"episode":2,"thumbnail":"https://s.err.ee/photo/crop/2018/10/19/557784h66d4t34.jpg","released":"2020-09-24"},{"id":"err-archive:1141746","title":"Miks mitte?!","season":1,"episode":3,"thumbnail":"https://s.err.ee/photo/crop/2018/10/18/582408h54a2t34.jpg","released":"2020-10-01"},{"id":"err-archive:1147375","title":"Miks mitte?!","season":1,"episode":4,"thumbnail":"https://s.err.ee/photo/crop/2018/11/02/583010h366at34.jpg","released":"2020-10-15"},{"id":"err-archive:1149950","title":"Miks mitte?!","season":1,"episode":5,"thumbnail":"https://s.err.ee/photo/crop/2020/05/19/780126h2d07t34.jpg","released":"2020-10-22"},{"id":"err-archive:1152706","title":"Miks mitte?!","season":1,"episode":6,"thumbnail":"https://s.err.ee/photo/crop/2018/12/03/583099h8d6ct34.jpg","released":"2020-10-29"},{"id":"err-archive:1155441","title":"Miks mitte?!","season":1,"episode":7,"thumbnail":"https://s.err.ee/photo/crop/2018/10/19/557785h36a2t34.jpg","released":"2020-11-05"},{"id":"err-archive:1158113","title":"Miks mitte?!","season":1,"episode":8,"thumbnail":"https: